msgid ""
"***WARNING: Responding to this message will reveal your username to the gildee.***\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"***警告：回覆這則訊息會讓收到金幣的人看到你的使用者名稱。***\n"
"\n"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:137
msgid ""
"Thanks for claiming a tippr gold code.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"感謝你領取 tippr 金幣代碼。\n"
"\n"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:138
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **monthly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each month until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional months of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"你即將為自己（%(user)s）設定持續、自動續訂的 tippr 金幣訂閱。\n"
"\n"
"你將**每月**支付 **%(price)s**。\n"
"\n"
">在你取消之前，此訂閱會每月自動續訂。你可以隨時取消。取消後，之後的月份將不會再收費，服務會持續到本期帳單結束。取消後，已付款的服務不會退款。收據會以私人訊息寄到你的帳號。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:139
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **yearly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each year until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional years of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"你即將為自己（%(user)s）設定持續、自動續訂的 tippr 金幣訂閱。\n"
"\n"
"你將**每年**支付 **%(price)s**。\n"
"\n"
">在你取消之前，此訂閱會每年自動續訂。你可以隨時取消。取消後，之後的年份將不會再收費，服務會持續到本期帳單結束。取消後，已付款的服務不會退款。收據會以私人訊息寄到你的帳號。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:140
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to make a one-time purchase of %(amount)s of tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "你即將為自己（%(user)s）一次購買 %(amount)s 的 tippr 金幣。你總共需要支付 %(price)s。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:141
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to purchase %(amount)s for Give Gold. It works like a gift certificate: each month of it gives someone one month of tippr gold. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "你即將購買 %(amount)s 的贈送金幣。它就像禮券：每一個月份可以送某人一個月的 tippr 金幣。你總共需要支付 %(price)s。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:142
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to purchase %(amount)s of tippr gold in the form of a gift code. The recipient (or you) will be able to claim the code to redeem that gold to their account. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "你即將以禮物代碼的形式購買 %(amount)s 的 tippr 金幣。收禮者（或你）可以用這個代碼把金幣兌換到自己的帳號。你總共需要支付 %(price)s。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:143
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to give %(amount)s of tippr gold to %(recipient)s, who will be told that it came from you. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "你即將送 %(amount)s 的 tippr 金幣給 %(recipient)s，對方會知道是你送的。你總共需要支付 %(price)s。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:144
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to give %(amount)s of tippr gold to %(recipient)s. It will be an anonymous gift. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "你即將送 %(amount)s 的 tippr 金幣給 %(recipient)s。這將是匿名禮物。你總共需要支付 %(price)s。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:145
#, python-format
msgid "Want to say thanks to *%(recipient)s* for this comment? Give them a month of [tippr gold](/gold/about)."
msgstr "想要對這篇 *%(recipient)s* 的留言表達感謝嗎？您可以送給他們一個月份的 [tippr 金幣](/gold/about)。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:146
#, python-format
msgid "Want to say thanks to *%(recipient)s* for this submission? Give them a month of [tippr gold](/gold/about)."
msgstr "想為這篇貼文向 *%(recipient)s* 道謝嗎？送他一個月的 [tippr 金幣](/gold/about)吧。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:147
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to give *%(recipient)s* a month of [tippr gold](/gold/about) for this comment:"
msgstr "你即將為這則留言送 *%(recipient)s* 一個月的 [tippr 金幣](/gold/about)："

#: r2/lib/strings.py:148
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to give *%(recipient)s* a month of [tippr gold](/gold/about) for this submission:"
msgstr "你即將為這篇貼文送 *%(recipient)s* 一個月的 [tippr 金幣](/gold/about)："

#: r2/lib/strings.py:149
#, python-format
msgid "You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "你總共需要支付 %(price)s。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:150 r2/templates/archivedinterstitial.html:38
msgid "This is an archived post. You won't be able to vote or comment."
msgstr "此為已歸檔的貼文。您不能於此貼文評分或留言。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:151
msgid "This post is locked. You won't be able to comment."
msgstr "這篇貼文已鎖定。你將無法留言。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:152
msgid "This page shows a history of recent activity on your account. If you notice unusual activity, you should change your password immediately. Location information is guessed from your computer's IP address and may be wildly wrong, especially for visits from mobile devices."
msgstr "這個頁面顯示你帳號最近的活動記錄。如果發現異常活動，請立即更改密碼。位置資訊是依據你電腦的 IP 位址推測的，可能非常不準確，尤其是用行動裝置造訪時。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:153
#, python-format
msgid "You are currently accessing tippr from this IP address: %(address)s."
msgstr "您目前是從 IP 位址 %(address)s 存取 tippr。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:154
msgid ""
"\n"
"These apps are authorized to access your account. Signing out of all sessions\n"
"will revoke access from all apps. You may also revoke access from individual\n"
"apps below.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"這些應用程式已獲授權存取你的帳號。登出所有工作階段\n"
"會撤銷所有應用程式的存取權。你也可以在下方撤銷個別\n"
"應用程式的存取權。\n"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:160
msgid "Below you will see your promotion's impression and click traffic per hour of promotion.  Please note that these traffic totals will lag behind by two to three hours, and that daily totals will be preliminary until 24 hours after the link has finished its run."
msgstr "下方是你的推廣每小時的曝光和點擊流量。請注意，這些流量總數會延遲兩到三小時，每日總數在連結刊登結束後 24 小時內都只是初步數字。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:161 r2/lib/strings.py:162
msgid "Traffic is counted as pages are viewed, and these graphs update every few minutes."
msgstr "流量會在頁面被瀏覽時計算，這些圖表每幾分鐘更新一次。"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:163
#, python-format
msgid "Questions? Email self serve support: %(email)s"
msgstr "有問題嗎？請寄信給自助廣告客服：%(email)s"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:165
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Below are the traffic statistics for your vault. Each graph represents one of the following over the interval specified.\n"
"\n"
"* **pageviews** are the pages people viewed in %(vault)s, including both listing pages and comment pages (not bots, feeds or the API).\n"
"* **uniques** are how many different people made those pageviews: each logged-in member counts once, and each logged-out visitor once per address and browser.\n"
"* **subscriptions** is the number of new subscriptions that have been generated in a given day. This number is less accurate than the first two metrics, as, though we can track new subscriptions, we have no way to track unsubscriptions.\n"
"\n"
"Note: there are a couple of places outside of your vault where someone can click \"subscribe\", so it is possible (though unlikely) that the subscription count can exceed the unique count on a given day.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"以下是你看板的流量統計。每張圖表代表指定期間內的下列其中一項。\n"
"\n"
"* **頁面瀏覽數** 是大家在 %(vault)s 瀏覽的頁面，包括列表頁和留言頁（不含機器人、訂閱來源或 API）。\n"
"* **不重複訪客** 是有多少不同的人產生了這些瀏覽：每位已登入的會員算一次，每位未登入的訪客依位址和瀏覽器各算一次。\n"
"* **訂閱數** 是某一天產生的新訂閱數量。這個數字比前兩項指標不準確，因為我們能追蹤新訂閱，卻無法追蹤取消訂閱。\n"
"\n"
"注意：在你的看板之外也有幾個地方可以點擊「訂閱」，所以某天的訂閱數有可能（雖然不太可能）超過不重複訪客數。\n"

